UID: SEC-2-1
TITLE: 2.1 Context

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
```mermaid
flowchart LR
    OP(["Operator"])
    subgraph KC["Safe Kiln Controller device"]
        MCU["ESP32-S3<br/>controller"]
        OLED["128x64 OLED"]
        ENC["Encoder<br/>+ button"]
